SELECT e.id, 179, 748.24, 751.34, 'Because it shows you have the courage to admit when you don''t know something,', '因为这说明你有勇气承认自己不知道某件事，', 'bɪkʌz ɪt ʃoʊz juː hæv ðə kɜːɹɪdʒ tʊ ɐdmɪt wɛn juː doʊnt noʊ sʌmθɪŋ,', '<span>Because</span><span>it</span><span tid="159440">shows</span><span>you</span><span>have</span><span>the</span><span tid="159444" class="highlight highlight-a">courage</span><span>to</span><span tid="159446" class="highlight highlight-a">admit</span><span>when</span><span>you</span><span>don''t</span><span>know</span><span>something,</span>'
