SELECT e.id, 53, 215.75, 222.41, 'It was beautiful, historical, artistically subtle in a way that science can''t capture,', '它美丽、古老，带着一种科学无法捕捉的艺术细腻感。', 'ɪt wʌz bjuːɾifəl, hɪstɔːɹɪkəl, ɑːɹtɪstɪkli sʌɾəl ɪn ɐ weɪ ðæt saɪəns kænt kæptʃɚ,', '<span>It</span><span>was</span><span tid="160398">beautiful,</span><span tid="160399" class="highlight highlight-a">historical,</span><span tid="160400">artistically</span><span tid="160401" class="highlight highlight-a">subtle</span><span>in</span><span>a</span><span tid="160404" class="highlight highlight-a">way</span><span>that</span><span tid="160406">science</span><span>can''t</span><span tid="160408" class="highlight highlight-a">capture,</span>'
