SELECT e.id, 110, 443.29, 448.17, 'In a remarkable turn of events, Apple bought NeXT, and I returned to Apple.', '在一次非凡的转折中，苹果收购了 NeXT，而我回到了苹果。', 'ɪn ɐ ɹᵻmɑːɹkəbəl tɜːn ʌv ᵻvɛnts, æpəl bɔːt niː ɛkstiː, ænd aɪ ɹᵻtɜːnd tʊ æpəl.', '<span>In</span><span>a</span><span tid="161031">remarkable</span><span tid="161032" class="highlight highlight-a">turn</span><span>of</span><span tid="161034">events,</span><span tid="161035">Apple</span><span tid="161036">bought</span><span tid="161037">NeXT,</span><span>and</span><span>I</span><span tid="161040" class="highlight highlight-a">returned</span><span>to</span><span tid="161042">Apple.</span>'
