SELECT e.id, 60, 225.4, 228.98, 'And so in this next video, I break down that exact system and', '所以在下一个视频里，我会拆解这个具体的系统，', 'ænd soʊ ɪn ðɪs nɛkst vɪdɪoʊ, aɪ bɹeɪk daʊn ðæt ɛɡzækt sɪstəm ænd', '<span>And</span><span>so</span><span>in</span><span>this</span><span tid="174414">next</span><span tid="174415">video,</span><span>I</span><span pid="4772" class="highlight highlight-d">break down</span><span>that</span><span tid="174420" class="highlight highlight-a">exact</span><span tid="174421">system</span><span>and</span>'
